commands.command:
/usr/bin/zsh -lc "cat > index.html <<'EOF'
<"'!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#173f49">
  <meta name="description" content="A quiet study. An independent film practice.">
  <title>A quiet study. — An independent film practice.</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; --ink: #f6f2e8; --night: #102b32; --line: rgba(246,242,232,.32); --accent: #f1b85b; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-padding-top: 24px; }
    body { margin: 0; background: var(--night); color: var(--ink); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 7px; }
    .skip { position: fixed; top: 16px; left: 16px; z-index: 10; padding: 14px 20px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--night); transform: translateY(-160%); }
    .skip:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
    .hero { position: relative; isolation: isolate; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 780px; min-height: max(780px, 100svh); overflow: hidden; background: #173f49; }
    .hero-art { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -3; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 70% center; }
    .hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -2; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(7,25,31,.46), transparent 75%), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(7,25,31,.88), rgba(7,25,31,.12) 65%); }
    .hero::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 18px; z-index: -1; border: 1px solid rgba(246,242,232,.18); pointer-events: none; }
    .masthead { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding: 45px 5.5%; }
    .label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.6; }
    .identity { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
    .frame-mark { width: 23px; height: 29px; border: 1px solid currentColor; position: relative; }
    .frame-mark::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 5px -5px; border: 1px solid currentColor; }
    .nav-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .nav-link:hover { border-color: var(--ink); }
    .hero-content { width: 100%; margin-top: auto; padding: 100px 8% 65px; }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 28px; color: #e2c992; }
    .hero-row { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; }
    h1 { max-width: 850px; margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, '"'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: clamp(76px, 9.2vw, 152px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: .98; }
    h1 span { display: block; }
    .intro { margin: 32px 0 0; font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px); line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: .015em; }
    .explore { display: flex; flex: 0 0 144px; width: 144px; height: 144px; padding: 21px; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; background: var(--ink); color: var(--night); font-size: 14px; }
    .explore .arrow { align-self: end; font-size: 31px; line-height: 1; }
    .explore:hover { background: var(--accent); }
    .hero-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin: 0 5.5%; padding: 22px 0 35px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .hero-footer p { margin: 0; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.7; }
    .hero-footer .still { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
    .still::before { content: \"\"; width: 5px; height: 5px; background: var(--accent); }
    .work { padding: 100px 8% 75px; background: #eeede5; color: var(--night); }
    .work-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    h2 { margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 72px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
    .work-number { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    figure { margin: 0; }
    .work-poster { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; background: #173f49; }
    figcaption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 24px; padding-top: 18px; }
    figcaption p { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .work a:focus-visible { outline-color: var(--night); }
    @media (min-width: 1700px) { .hero-content, .work { padding-left: max(8%, calc((100vw - 1450px)/2)); padding-right: max(8%, calc((100vw - 1450px)/2)); } }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .hero { min-height: max(740px, 100svh); }
      .hero::after { inset: 10px; }
      .masthead { padding: 30px 7%; gap: 18px; }
      .label { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .1em; }
      .identity { gap: 11px; }
      .frame-mark { width: 17px; height: 23px; }
      .nav-link { gap: 9px; }
      .hero-art { object-position: 72% center; }
      .hero-content { padding: 90px 8% 38px; }
      .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 22px; }
      .hero-row { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 34px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(64px, 17vw, 116px); }
      .intro { margin-top: 23px; }
      .explore { flex-basis: auto; width: 108px; height: 108px; padding: 16px; }
      .hero-footer { margin: 0 8%; padding-bottom: 26px; }
      .hero-footer p { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .09em; }
      .work { padding: 64px 8% 48px; }
      .work-heading { margin-bottom: 28px; }
      figcaption { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
    @media (forced-colors: active) { .explore { border: 1px solid ButtonText; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class=\"skip\" href=\"#work\">Skip to selected work</a>
  <main>
    <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">
      <img class=\"hero-art\" src=\"assets/poster.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" fetchpriority=\"high\">
      <header class=\"masthead\">
        <div class=\"identity\"><span class=\"frame-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"label\">Film / Practice</span></div>
        <nav aria-label=\"Main\"><a class=\"nav-link label\" href=\"#work\">Selected work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></nav>
      </header>
      <div class=\"hero-content\">
        <p class=\"eyebrow label\">An independent perspective</p>
        <div class=\"hero-row\">
          <div>
            <h1 id=\"hero-title\">A quiet <span>study.</span></h1>
            <p class=\"intro\">An independent film practice.</p>
          </div>
          <a class=\"explore\" href=\"#work\"><span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↘</span><span>Explore</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class=\"hero-footer\"><p class=\"still\">Static poster preview</p><p>Image / A quiet study.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class=\"work\" id=\"work\" aria-labelledby=\"work-title\">
      <div class=\"work-heading\"><h2 id=\"work-title\">Selected work</h2><span class=\"work-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01 / STILL</span></div>
      <figure>
        <img class=\"work-poster\" src=\"assets/poster.svg\" alt=\"A warm amber circle above a pale green curved landscape against a deep teal sky.\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\">
        <figcaption><p class=\"label\">Poster preview</p><p>Static preview. Requested footage has not been supplied.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
EOF
cat > NOTES.md <<'EOF'
# Authoring notes

- Delivered "'`index.html`: cinematic static hero, exact requested heading/body, square Explore link to `#work`, and Selected work section.
- Local guidance read: qs-design-frontend and its brief, design-direction, implementation, cinematic-landing, media-recipes, restrained-style references.
- Selected treatment: static poster composition informed by R4 framing/text protection; no footage lifecycle or motion. Teal/cream/amber palette, system serif/sans, square controls, dark text scrim. Hero crop 70% center desktop / 72% center mobile; work preview preserves the full 16:9 poster.
- Source: supplied `assets/poster.svg`, repository-owned synthetic fixture per `assets/rights.json`. The manifest mentions scene.webm, but that file is absent; no video source was invented or substituted.
- Static HTML/CSS needs no JavaScript, external fonts, dependencies, or network services. Poster and readable text remain available without playback; page labels its static state and missing footage.
- Validation: one shell content check for required text, local poster, fragment destination, square CTA, and absence of video/external sources. Browser/runtime, responsive appearance, keyboard behavior, and playback are unverified; central observer owns qualification. No browser, server, installation, or second verification workflow used.
EOF'
